    "description": "<p>You gain this state while lurking in darkness and lose it while illuminated by a light source.</p><p></p><p>Most monsters can see perfectly in the dark and gain a +4 bonus to accuracy, guard, and resist while they have this state. Trespassers gain half these bonuses (+2), but only when attacking or defending against a light-dependent creature who is illuminated. Two light-dependent creatures in darkness have no bonuses against each other.</p>",
